OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of people affected by
OL,4,Awater supply issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people in North
OL,7,FLincolnshire have been affected by
OL,8,Fwater supply issues due to burst pipes
OL,9,Fovernight.
OL,11,FA number of schools have been closed
OL,12,Ffor the day, including John Leggott
OL,13,FCollege, Messingham Primary School and
OL,14,FSt Hugh's School.
OL,16,FAnglian Water said 36,000 customers in
OL,17,FScunthorpe and the surrounding area
OL,18,Fwere impacted after two pipes burst,
OL,19,Fwhich temporarily stopped water flowing
OL,20,Finto the local storage reservoir.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
