OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of people affected by
OL,4,Awater supply issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson thanked people for their
OL,7,Fpatience and said: "We're really sorry
OL,8,Fthat some customers may be experiencing
OL,9,Flow water pressure, or even no water at
OL,10,Fall."
